      "cooked": "<p>Possible Guise bug with Hey I'm That Guy. &nbsp;Was playing against Plague Rat. &nbsp;Heroes were Legacy, Skyscraper, Guise, Mr. Fixer (in that order). &nbsp;All heroes were infected. &nbsp;Legacy had Inspiring Presence in play. &nbsp;Guise played Uh, Yeah I'm That Guy (UYITG). &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The game asked me which I wanted to take effect first (Inspiring Presence or Infection). &nbsp;When I chose Infection, the game said \"No more copies of Infection in deck!\" and then proceeded to play the next card off of Plague Rat's deck. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Any reason why that should happen?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
