      "created_at": "2016-11-21T22:05:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Text of infection is \"When this card is played if all Heroes are infected play the top card of the villian deck...\" Since everyone was infected it played the top card of the deck. Assuming you didn't close the program I assume that Um... Yeah i'm That Guy moved itelf to the villain trash as per the second sentence on Infection.&nbsp;</p><p>So in short, not a bug, just one of the wonderful peculiarities of being Guise.</p>",
