      "created_at": "2016-11-21T22:23:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It still shouldn't check for copies of Infection in the villain deck. &nbsp;The actual result makes sense (UYITG is discarded and the top card of the villain deck is played), but that message seems to be erroneous. &nbsp;I wonder what would have happened if there had been a copy of Infection in the deck.</p>",
